  "title": "Sliced Tomatoes with Fresh Herb Dressing",
  "description": "Sliced tomatoes are marinated in olive oil with chopped fresh thyme, oregano, parsley, chives and garlic, then topped with Parmesan cheese to make a garden-fresh side dish.",
